    {"slug": "read-01", "voice": "M2", "vai": "Khang", "text": "My neighbourhood. I live in the suburbs of Da Nang City. There are many things I like about my neighbourhood.", "ten_viet": [{"tu": "Da Nang", "doc": "Đà Nẵng"}]},
    {"slug": "read-02", "voice": "M2", "vai": "Khang", "text": "It's great for outdoor activities because it has beautiful parks, sandy beaches and fine weather. There's almost everything I need here: shops, restaurants, and markets. The people here are friendlier, and the food is better than in other places."},
    {"slug": "read-03", "voice": "M2", "vai": "Khang", "text": "However, there are two things I dislike about it: there are many modern buildings and offices; and the streets are busy and crowded."}
